WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.055 --> 00:00:03.311
NORTHERN CALIFORNIA.

00:00:03.313 --> 00:00:05.041
&gt;&gt; THANKS, WILLIAM.

00:00:05.042 --> 00:00:06.687
ANOTHER GOVERNMENT OFFICIAL

00:00:06.722 --> 00:00:08.009
FACING CLAIMS OF COVID

00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:09.348
HYPOCRISY.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.228
MAYOR OF AUSTIN, TEXAS NOW

00:00:12.229 --> 00:00:17.367
APOLOGIZING, TELLING PEOPLE TO

00:00:17.368 --> 00:00:22.325
STAY HOME AND STOP THE SPREAD.

00:00:22.326 --> 00:00:25.395
CASEY STEGALL PICKS UP REPORTING

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:26.565
IN DALLAS HERE.

00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:26.905
CASEY?

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.410
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN’T MAKE THIS UP.

00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:30.120
BUT IN ORDER TO UNDERSTAND THE

00:00:30.121 --> 00:00:31.701
TIME LINES, WE HAVE TO START AT

00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:32.619
THE BEGINNING.

00:00:32.654 --> 00:00:34.392
WATCH MAYOR STEVE ADLER, THE

00:00:34.393 --> 00:00:37.074
MAYOR OF AUSTIN, WATCH HIS PLEA

00:00:37.075 --> 00:00:39.373
TO THE PUBLIC FROM A FEW WEEKS

00:00:39.407 --> 00:00:39.800
AGO.

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:42.726
&gt;&gt; WE NEED TO STAY HOME, IF YOU

00:00:42.727 --> 00:00:44.516
CAN, DO EVERYTHING YOU CAN TO

00:00:44.518 --> 00:00:46.671
TRY TO KEEP THE NUMBERS DOWN.

00:00:46.706 --> 00:00:49.368
THIS IS NOT THE TIME TO RELAX.

00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:51.067
WE MAY HAVE TO CLOSE THINGS DOWN

00:00:51.101 --> 00:00:52.316
IF WE’RE NOT CAREFUL.

00:00:52.317 --> 00:00:54.178
&gt;&gt; NOW, YOU NOTICE THE CEILING

00:00:54.212 --> 00:00:55.609
WAS SHOWING.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:57.503
PERHAPS ADLER HAD THE CAMERA

00:00:57.537 --> 00:00:59.371
TILTED UP SO PEOPLE CONTINUE SAY

00:00:59.405 --> 00:01:01.094
SAND AND PALM TREES.

00:01:01.096 --> 00:01:02.757
HE WAS IN CABO, SAN LUCAS,

00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:04.784
MEXICO AT HIS TIME SHARE.

00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:06.773
BEEN THERE A DAY AFTER FLYING

00:01:06.807 --> 00:01:08.276
DOWN ON HIS PRIVATE JET WITH

00:01:08.311 --> 00:01:09.733
EIGHT OTHER PEOPLE AFTER HIS

00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:10.821
DAUGHTER GOT MARRIED.

00:01:10.823 --> 00:01:12.766
IT HAPPENED TO BE AT A TIME WHEN

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:14.725
AUSTIN WAS STRUGGLING WITH A

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.217
SPIKE OF NEW CORONAVIRUS

00:01:16.252 --> 00:01:17.315
INFECTIONS AND HOSPITALIZATIONS.

00:01:17.349 --> 00:01:19.889
LATE YESTERDAY ALL OF THIS NEWS

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.133
WAS LEAKING AND STARTED MAKING

00:01:21.134 --> 00:01:22.830
THE ROUNDS.

00:01:22.831 --> 00:01:25.463
HOURS LATER, YOU GUESSED IT,

00:01:25.464 --> 00:01:28.292
ROLL THE TAPE.

00:01:28.293 --> 00:01:32.143
&gt;&gt; I’M SORRY I TOOK THAT TRIP.

00:01:32.145 --> 00:01:34.493
IT WAS A LAPSE IN JUDGMENT.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:37.667
I WANT YOU TO KNOW I APOLOGIZE.

00:01:37.701 --> 00:01:39.889
I WANT YOU TO KNOW THAT I REGRET

00:01:39.924 --> 00:01:40.896
THAT TRAVEL.

00:01:40.897 --> 00:01:43.502
I WOULDN’T TRAVEL NOW.

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:46.228
I DIDN’T OVER THANKSGIVING.

00:01:46.263 --> 00:01:47.860
I WON’T OVER CHRISTMAS.

00:01:47.894 --> 00:01:49.260
AND NO ONE SHOULD.

00:01:49.295 --> 00:01:51.251
&gt;&gt; THAT APOLOGY VIDEO GOING ON

00:01:51.285 --> 00:01:53.494
TO SAY THAT HE STILL, HOWEVER,

00:01:53.528 --> 00:01:55.153
DID NOT VIOLATE ANY ORDERS AND

00:01:55.188 --> 00:01:56.469
THAT HE CONSULTED HIS OWN HEALTH

00:01:56.503 --> 00:01:57.399
OFFICIALS BEFORE THE WEDDING AND

00:01:57.433 --> 00:01:58.648
THE TRIP.

00:01:58.682 --> 00:02:01.179
20 GUESTS WERE INVITED TO HIS

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.339
DAUGHTER’S WEDDING, WHICH WAS

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:06.482
HELD IN A BOUTIQUE IN AUSTIN

00:02:06.483 --> 00:02:09.670
WHEN THE CITY WAS UNDER A STAGE

00:02:09.705 --> 00:02:11.519
3 ADVISORY.

00:02:11.553 --> 00:02:13.968
TEN GROUPS DISCOURAGED HIM.

